{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [secret-exposure]: shell read of a credential-bearing path. Reference the single environment variable an integration needs; never print secret files. [command-sha256:b460c0bac0f7baeeb823d5b9be912992c8d8ea3113343b98be4061ad0876df06] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
